If you want to build your own Cyloidal drive, let https://pcbway.com/g/RE6Nqt [aff] take care of the machining.
This was one heck of a project, but I made it in the end. A (nearly) zero-backlash 4th axis for my home made milling machine.
We've got merch! https://notanengineer.shop
If you want to follow the projects a little closer, head over to https://www.patreon.com/NotAnEngineer.
