Sources:
@HowToMechatronics - What is Cycloidal Drive? Designing, 3D Printing and Testing https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OsS9-FzKN6s
@LeviJanssen - Has a lot of great videos on cycloidal drives
@jamesbruton - also has a lot of great videos on cycloidal drives
the best look inside a real cycloidal drive I could find: @arduinoversusevil2025 (AvE) - BOLTR: SUMITOMO CYCLO GEARBOX | Zero Backlash! https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dYVPU47c9WA&t=577s&pp=ygUPY3ljbG9pZGFsIGRyaXZl
